Package: box86-16k
Architecture: armhf
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libc6
Description: Box86 with non-4K host-page support for Raspberry Pi 5
 Box86 userspace i386 emulator patched to load 4K-aligned ELF32 PT_LOAD
 segments correctly on hosts with 16K pages. Includes a Raspberry Pi 5
 arm64/armhf build profile, replacement binfmt rule, Steam launcher, and
 synthetic 16K ELF regression test.
